# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) to point the local dev server at the
# remote test server instead of pure mocks. See frontend/README.md.
# Leave both unset (or this file uncopied) for the default: everything mock.

# Vite dev-server proxy target for /api/* — avoids CORS/cookie-SameSite
# issues a direct cross-origin fetch would hit. No trailing slash.
# VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET=https://tb.example.com

# Comma-separated list of api.* domains to call for real instead of mock.
# Only `auth` (specifically `/me`) is wired to a real branch as of I0.
# VITE_API_REAL_DOMAINS=auth
